---
export const prerender = true;
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
import LegalStatus from '../components/LegalStatus.astro';
---

<Content
  kicker="Legal"
  title="Payouts & Withdrawals"
  description="How to withdraw unused avaTOK tokens — supported payout methods, verification, fees, and tax."
  image="/og/payouts.png"
  lead="How unused tokens are withdrawn, who handles the payment, and what is deducted along the way."
  updated="2026-08-05"
  helpHref="/help/billing/withdrawing-your-earnings"
>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.c09f2e94e0a3c15d">This page explains how withdrawals work on avaTOK. It sits alongside our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>, <a data-i18n="web-payouts.188dc350278985ab" href="/tokens">Tokens &amp; Wallet</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.6ff532f01420d686">policy,</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.9990ef8acf0108bc" href="/refunds">Refunds &amp; Cancellations</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.16047a3f9597e500">policy, and</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.5e2a4b33bff1936b" href="/pricing-fees">Pricing &amp; Fees</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.2c0560d6168d330b">page.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <div class="note">
    <p>
      <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.25f053946fd14372">Unused tokens can be withdrawn.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.382bf3f7003c393b">They convert back at the fixed rate shown at
      checkout. What reaches your account is that amount less the transfer fee, any applicable tax
      where due, and any charge your own bank applies. Every figure is shown before you confirm.</ui-copy>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.ed655b8c47968463" id="status">1. Who pays you</h2>
  <LegalStatus variant="full" />
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.71333e7857f52c57">
    Payouts are made by Ava Global International, Inc., a Delaware corporation, subject to the
    applicable product terms and payment-provider requirements.
  </p>
  <div class="note">
    <p>
      <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.5638d531837ce1f9">Payouts are in test and are not open to the public.</strong> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.269a92be71c604a0">Our application for a
      payment-provider availability is under review. Until it is approved, withdrawals
      are limited to invited users, are processed manually, and may be delayed or paused. Do not
      treat avaTOK as a source of income during this period.</ui-copy>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.f34196c1852073a7">2. Who can withdraw</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.fd430aae7dd9c2e1">Withdrawal is available to account holders with an</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.3676c8b7be74d1c2">unused token balance</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.25ac9987f652f688">, where
    the account is in good standing and the withdrawal is permitted in your country. Tokens already
    spent cannot be withdrawn. Withdrawal may be unavailable while an account is suspended or under
    review, or where a payment dispute is open.</ui-copy>
  </p>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.d349fb3c58a94146">The value of the balance you are withdrawing is worked out at the fixed rate of</ui-copy>
    <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.ba2849aa0d2a2a49">1 token = ₹1</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.7158d23475846941">. Tokens are not converted at a different rate on the way out than
    on the way in.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.f80b0037584fdd8b">3. Supported payout methods</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.41748526f53dd3ba">Where withdrawals are available, payouts are sent to a</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.8d414cdcc99eef62">verified payout method held in
    your name</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.e8169c62de522a4a">. The receiving account must belong to the account holder. We may decline a
    payout to a third party's account.</ui-copy>
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.f87b85a5d6dd28ca">
    Any currency conversion, transfer fee, and applicable tax are shown before you confirm.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.028bd0aca11d5b84">
    Please make sure the payout details you enter are correct. A payout sent to valid but incorrect
    address that you supplied may not be recoverable.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.d65134c6b479e6ca">4. Availability</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.f766b4d7b11bec82">
    Payout availability depends on your location, account status, and the payment methods enabled
    for your account. Payouts are made in the local currency supported for your account only; we
    do not promise a particular currency or cross-border conversion. When availability changes we
    will update this page.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.4d4a291a3e429745">5. Verification before payout</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.60b338f0f4584862">A withdrawal may be subject to verification of your identity and of the receiving account before
    it is released. We may ask you to confirm ownership of the bank account, payout address, or payout
    method, and we may hold or decline a payout until any check we consider necessary is complete.
    Information collected for this purpose is handled under our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.506ff394621596dd" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.0baae42cd4299c22">6. Transfer fee and taxes</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.2e080f88d0cd99b0">Withdrawals are subject to a</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.530ff386309b28ad">transfer fee</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.6b3cddaba24aaaa7">. The fee and any tax are shown to you
    at the time of withdrawal, before you
    confirm — please read that screen, as it is the authoritative figure for your withdrawal. We do
    not publish a fixed rate here because fees can vary by payout method and provider.</ui-copy>
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.c4f51e89f0e3f517">
    The amount that reaches your account is the amount withdrawn less the fee, any tax, and any
    charge applied by your own bank or payment provider.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.6d83dd7b363be330">7. Tax withholding</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.3a9ebee399098d2f">
    Where tax law requires withholding on marketplace payouts, we may
    withhold the required amount and remit it to the authorities. Similar withholding may apply in
    other jurisdictions where the law requires it. We may ask you for tax details before releasing a
    payout, and we may decline a payout until they are provided.
  </p>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.b8e6ccdddfbbcaa0">
    You are responsible for your own tax position, including declaring your earnings and paying any
    tax due on them. Nothing on this page is tax advice.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.f17521bda50570df">8. Minimum balance</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.8a054a60007129ee">
    A minimum withdrawable balance may apply. Where it does, it is shown in the withdrawal screen.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.4fda8955a341ac22">9. Timelines</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.e6650bc008527cb0">Any timeframe shown to you is an</ui-copy> <strong data-i18n="web-payouts.38dc2caf32c56ef2">estimate, not a guarantee</strong><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.a4dea1a2454ba848">. Payouts depend on
    verification, on our payment partners, and on your bank. Public holidays, banking cut-offs, and
    additional checks can extend the time taken.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.8dbc147a1c178438">10. Failed or returned payouts</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.eede494681bbfa6b">
    If a payout fails or is returned — for example because the payout method is inactive, the bank
    account is closed, or the details do not match — we will normally return the amount to your
    token balance so you can try again with corrected details. A fee already incurred on a failed
    attempt may not be recoverable. Repeated failures may require you to re-verify the receiving
    account.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.ab2e3e087e957803">11. Fraud, AML, and holds</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.7861902c7ac7cfdc">We may delay, hold, reduce, or decline a payout where we reasonably suspect fraud, money
    laundering, sanctions exposure, abuse of the platform, or a breach of our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.4afa55bf7aec7ddc" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.f94ad5a13ade19d5">, or where we are required or permitted to do so by law or
    by a payment partner. We may also set off amounts you owe us — for example a chargeback, a
    reversed transaction, or a refund we have issued to a customer — against a pending payout.</ui-copy>
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.9cabc45e1c7ecf04">12. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p data-i18n="web-payouts.73ee27295f2ed9be">
    We may update this policy from time to time. We will post the updated version here and revise
    the "Last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2 data-i18n="web-payouts.6307b59edd6550a5">13. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.ba76a68328a5305b">Payout and billing questions:</ui-copy> <a href="mailto:support@avatok.ai">support@avatok.ai</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.a2bd067f82126b7a">. General
    enquiries:</ui-copy> <a href="mailto:hello@avatok.ai">hello@avatok.ai</a><ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.bf2fb03dedc02906">. See also our</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.188dc350278985ab" href="/tokens">Tokens &amp; Wallet</a> <ui-copy style="display:contents" data-i18n="web-payouts.6d122f7fa28a3b2f">policy and</ui-copy>
    <a data-i18n="web-payouts.5e2a4b33bff1936b" href="/pricing-fees">Pricing &amp; Fees</a>.
  </p>
</Content>
